  "group": "Racing",
  "tilt": true,
  "notes": "Matches F1 25's default Xbox controls: gears A/X, DRS and pit limiter Y, overtake B, radio LB, camera RB, look back RS click, flashback View, pause Menu, MFD D-pad. F1 24 swaps radio (RB) and overtake (LB).",
